WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:31.916
In the previous verse, we learned

2
00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:33.083
that if one wants to escape

3
00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:35.666
from the influence of sattva, rajas, and tamas,

4
00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:38.333
then one must take shelter of Lord Krishna.

5
00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.625
But now a natural question

6
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:42.416
must have surely arisen in the mind -

7
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:45.416
if this path is so clear,

8
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.875
then why doesn't everyone

9
00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:49.208
walk on this path?

10
00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.291
This verse has the answer to this.

11
00:00:51.291 --> 00:00:52.500
This verse explains four

12
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.958
types of people

13
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:57.833
who don't adopt the path of surrender

14
00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.416
to Lord Krishna.

15
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:08.250
Surrender to Lord Krishna is the path
 to liberation from māyā.

16
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.958
But still many people don't take His shelter.

17
00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:13.041
Lord Krishna

18
00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:14.708
is explaining about those very people

19
00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:17.291
through this verse.

20
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:20.458
He explains that not only ignorance,

21
00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:22.583
but a person's own decisions

22
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:23.333
and thoughts

23
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:26.416
also prevent them from coming
 to Krishna's shelter.

24
00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:31.458
Krishna begins this verse by
 calling these people duşkřtinah.

25
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.500
Duṣkṛtinaḥ means

26
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.125
those who because of their actions,

27
00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:38.416
keep moving away from spiritual truth.

28
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:42.708
Křtih means good or excellent actions,

29
00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:43.958
while dușkṛti shows

30
00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:44.875
those actions

31
00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:46.666
opposite to this

32
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:49.000
which take one away from the Lord.

33
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.750
After this,

34
00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.666
Krishna mentions

35
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.916
four types of people

36
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:55.458
who don't surrender to Him.

37
00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:56.791
Those four people are:

38
00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:59.708
mūḍhāḥ, meaning the foolish.

39
00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:00.875
Narādhamāḥ,

40
00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:03.541
meaning the lowest among humans.

41
00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:05.541
Māyayāpahṛta-jñānāḥ,

42
00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:10.625
meaning those whose knowledge
 has been stolen by māyā.

43
00:02:10.625 --> 00:02:12.541
Āsuraṁ bhāvam āśritāḥ,

44
00:02:12.541 --> 00:02:15.958
meaning those who are of demonic nature.

45
00:02:15.958 --> 00:02:18.000
Let us understand this.

46
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.041
First, mūdhāḥ, meaning the foolish -

47
00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:26.916
These people commit the foolishness
 of spending their entire energy and time

48
00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:31.375
only on livelihood and
 some trivial material pleasures.

49
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:34.458
However life is going, they let it go.

50
00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:39.375
If an opportunity to learn something
 for progress comes, they ignore it.

51
00:02:39.375 --> 00:02:41.875
The essence of spirituality is very

52
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:45.250
close to them, but they don't pay attention to it.

53
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:48.041
And this is foolishness, because

54
00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:49.958
even while not being completely happy with life,

55
00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:52.041
they don't move forward,

56
00:02:52.041 --> 00:02:55.541
neither personally nor spiritually.

57
00:02:55.541 --> 00:02:56.458
After that,

58
00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:59.458
the second type of people, narādhamāḥ -

59
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:00.708
those who have intelligence,

60
00:03:00.708 --> 00:03:01.833
but still

61
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:04.250
they're at a low level of spirituality.

62
00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.875
Their downfall is happening,

63
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:09.416
because for them, material
 success is everything.

64
00:03:09.416 --> 00:03:11.541
Human life is a unique opportunity

65
00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:14.083
that's received for spiritual progress.

66
00:03:14.083 --> 00:03:17.125
But some people waste this opportunity.

67
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:21.500
These people run only after
 material success and pleasure,

68
00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.208
which takes them away from the Lord's truth.

69
00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:28.833
After this, māyayāpahṛta-jñānāḥ -

70
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.541
These people are endowed with
 intellect and knowledge

71
00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:34.500
and have deep knowledge of many subjects.

72
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.833
They discuss many topics,

73
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:40.500
even they’ve read about spirituality.

74
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.333
They can talk on this subject, but

75
00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:45.083
they don't practice

76
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:47.125
this knowledge in their life.

77
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:49.708
Under māyā's influence,
 this knowledge of theirs,

78
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:52.791
instead of taking them to spiritual truth, 

79
00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:55.291
entangles them in māyā's web.

80
00:03:55.291 --> 00:03:57.000
They use their intellect

81
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.041
to justify material life

82
00:04:00.041 --> 00:04:03.333
and move away from truth.

83
00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:05.833
And then the fourth type of people,

84
00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:10.666
āsuram bhāvam āśritāḥ,
 meaning of demonic nature -

85
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:14.000
These people not only
 stay away from spirituality,

86
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.791
but also strongly oppose it.

87
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:18.458
Their mind is filled with ego

88
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.083
and hatred toward the Lord.

89
00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:24.583
And they don't keep this
 feeling limited to themselves,

90
00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:28.541
but also try to weaken others' faith

91
00:04:28.541 --> 00:04:30.416
and consider taking shelter of the Lord

92
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:32.666
as a great weakness.

93
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:34.541
Without taking shelter of Krishna,

94
00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:37.041
liberation from māyā's bondage isn't possible.

95
00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:38.458
And these four categories

96
00:04:38.458 --> 00:04:40.625
give us the opportunity to think

97
00:04:40.625 --> 00:04:41.125
whether

98
00:04:41.125 --> 00:04:45.041
we too are getting trapped
 in any of these tendencies.

99
00:04:45.041 --> 00:04:45.958
What is it

100
00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:48.166
that's preventing us from complete surrender

101
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:49.875
to Krishna?

102
00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:51.708
This is worth thinking about.

103
00:04:56.541 --> 00:05:01.541
If you too are desirous of escaping māyā's cycle,

104
00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:04.791
are desirous of surrender to Me,

105
00:05:04.791 --> 00:05:07.791
or if it's feeling

106
00:05:07.791 --> 00:05:11.500
that you're moving away from Me,

107
00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.291
then for its remedy, first of all

108
00:05:15.291 --> 00:05:17.250
it must be known

109
00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:22.708
what's stopping you.

110
00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:24.500
In this verse,

111
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:29.000
I explain about those four tendencies

112
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.541
that prevent anyone

113
00:05:30.541 --> 00:05:34.416
from coming to My shelter.

114
00:05:34.416 --> 00:05:36.458
This isn't only for those

115
00:05:36.458 --> 00:05:40.041
who are away from spirituality, but

116
00:05:40.041 --> 00:05:41.875
also for those

117
00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:44.750
who are walking on the spiritual path

118
00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:48.416
but sometimes unknowingly

119
00:05:48.416 --> 00:05:51.625
get trapped in these tendencies.

120
00:05:51.625 --> 00:05:54.916
So just knowing these tendencies

121
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:56.958
will awaken you.

122
00:05:56.958 --> 00:06:01.875
You'll automatically start realizing

123
00:06:01.875 --> 00:06:03.500
'Yes,

124
00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.541
perhaps I too

125
00:06:05.541 --> 00:06:09.083
am making this very mistake.'

126
00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:12.791
The first tendency is of foolishness.

127
00:06:12.791 --> 00:06:17.125
Such a time comes in every person's life.

128
00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:20.083
You get so busy in daily tasks,

129
00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:23.375
in the race for material pleasures,

130
00:06:23.375 --> 00:06:26.458
that like a fool you forget

131
00:06:26.458 --> 00:06:29.666
whether this life

132
00:06:29.666 --> 00:06:34.375
is even giving you joy or not.

133
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:37.916
You keep increasing life's burden,

134
00:06:37.916 --> 00:06:43.375
believing that you must do everything yourself,

135
00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:47.458
whereas My help is always

136
00:06:47.458 --> 00:06:51.208
near you.

137
00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:52.666
Are you

138
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:56.083
committing this foolishness somewhere?

139
00:06:56.083 --> 00:06:58.375
The second tendency -

140
00:06:58.375 --> 00:07:03.083
of downfall instead of spiritual upliftment,

141
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:06.125
of lowering one's level.

142
00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:06.791
Have you

143
00:07:06.791 --> 00:07:11.125
become so absorbed in material attractions

144
00:07:11.125 --> 00:07:13.375
that you've started ignoring the life purpose

145
00:07:13.375 --> 00:07:16.666
of spiritual upliftment?

146
00:07:16.666 --> 00:07:20.833
You're not taking any step toward this.

147
00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:24.958
You run in material matters, but laziness comes

148
00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:28.125
in taking spiritual steps.

149
00:07:28.125 --> 00:07:29.750
Is it like this

150
00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.583
somewhere?

151
00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:33.958
The third tendency -

152
00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:36.000
of knowledge

153
00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:39.083
being stolen by māyā.

154
00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:40.166
Having knowledge

155
00:07:40.166 --> 00:07:44.375
and using intellect is good,

156
00:07:44.375 --> 00:07:47.333
but if this knowledge doesn't take you

157
00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:52.333
toward humility and spirituality,

158
00:07:52.333 --> 00:07:55.875
then this is māyā's influence.

159
00:07:55.875 --> 00:08:00.791
An open mind and humility are needed to

160
00:08:00.791 --> 00:08:04.291
understand spiritual life's essence.

161
00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:08.583
Are you losing humility somewhere?

162
00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:12.583
Is your thinking becoming narrow

163
00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:15.750
about spirituality somewhere?

164
00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.291
The fourth tendency -

165
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:20.541
demonic tendency.

166
00:08:20.541 --> 00:08:23.708
Is this ego coming in you somewhere

167
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:26.125
that what need do you have

168
00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:29.791
of any guidance?

169
00:08:29.791 --> 00:08:33.083
Or when something bad happens,

170
00:08:33.083 --> 00:08:37.708
have you started getting angry at the Lord?

171
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:39.625
And if you find yourself

172
00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:45.041
victim of any of these tendencies,

173
00:08:45.041 --> 00:08:47.666
then understand this not as self-reproach

174
00:08:47.666 --> 00:08:51.083
but as a golden opportunity for change.

175
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:53.625
Now you're knowing

176
00:08:53.625 --> 00:08:56.750
what's stopping you.

177
00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.708
Now only the solution is needed.

178
00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:05.708
And the solution is always with you.

179
00:09:05.708 --> 00:09:10.666
This Gita is always with you.

180
00:09:10.666 --> 00:09:15.041
Even if little by little, its study will protect you

181
00:09:15.041 --> 00:09:19.750
from every harmful tendency.

182
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:29.208
From spirituality, love increases
 in the entire family,

183
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:31.666
joy increases.

184
00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:34.333
But inspiring the family toward spirituality,

185
00:09:34.333 --> 00:09:39.166
creating a spiritual environment,

186
00:09:39.166 --> 00:09:44.000
can definitely be difficult. And if this is so,

187
00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.041
then understand these four tendencies

188
00:09:47.041 --> 00:09:48.083
which can affect

189
00:09:48.083 --> 00:09:51.083
the entire house's environment

190
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:55.166
and can create obstacles in the family's

191
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:57.625
path to spirituality.

192
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:03.375
The first harmful tendency, of foolishness -

193
00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:06.291
This appears in the family

194
00:10:06.291 --> 00:10:08.666
when all individuals become so busy

195
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:11.666
in their work and routine

196
00:10:11.666 --> 00:10:14.000
that they don't take out

197
00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.625
even a few moments for spiritual contemplation.

198
00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:19.500
Completely forgetting spiritual duties

199
00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.625
behind material responsibilities

200
00:10:23.625 --> 00:10:27.208
is foolishness.

201
00:10:27.208 --> 00:10:29.750
Even if for just a few moments,

202
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:32.458
give time to spirituality.

203
00:10:32.458 --> 00:10:34.708
Pray together,

204
00:10:34.708 --> 00:10:35.875
study just one verse

205
00:10:35.875 --> 00:10:40.333
of the Gita daily.

206
00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:43.291
Discuss spiritual topics

207
00:10:43.291 --> 00:10:47.375
even if small.

208
00:10:47.375 --> 00:10:51.625
The second harmful tendency,

209
00:10:51.625 --> 00:10:54.291
narādhamāḥ -

210
00:10:54.291 --> 00:10:56.250
meaning where humans have

211
00:10:56.250 --> 00:11:01.166
started falling to lower levels,
 their downfall is happening.

212
00:11:01.166 --> 00:11:04.541
This will definitely sound bitter to hear,

213
00:11:04.541 --> 00:11:05.625
but

214
00:11:05.625 --> 00:11:08.750
if someone themselves is
 absorbed in materialism,

215
00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.083
inspires others in the family also

216
00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:15.458
to remain absorbed in this,

217
00:11:15.458 --> 00:11:20.000
then this is going toward downfall.

218
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.291
In such a case,

219
00:11:21.291 --> 00:11:24.333
it becomes the responsibility of family elders

220
00:11:24.333 --> 00:11:25.458
to regulate

221
00:11:25.458 --> 00:11:28.583
spiritual education in the family.

222
00:11:28.583 --> 00:11:32.833
Only from this will this
 tendency slowly be removed.

223
00:11:32.833 --> 00:11:35.000
The third tendency,

224
00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:39.208
of knowledge being stolen by māyā -

225
00:11:39.208 --> 00:11:41.500
This happens in the family

226
00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.708
when everyone respects knowledge,

227
00:11:44.708 --> 00:11:49.291
emphasis is also placed on
 educational success, but

228
00:11:49.291 --> 00:11:51.750
it's understood that only and only

229
00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:54.458
this education is necessary.

230
00:11:54.458 --> 00:11:56.625
Spiritual subjects are also considered

231
00:11:56.625 --> 00:11:59.125
only an entertaining

232
00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:00.458
topic for discussion.

233
00:12:00.458 --> 00:12:01.583
But

234
00:12:01.583 --> 00:12:05.625
spirituality isn't practiced in life.

235
00:12:05.625 --> 00:12:07.833
Remember,

236
00:12:07.833 --> 00:12:10.583
life transformation won't
 happen just by discussing

237
00:12:10.583 --> 00:12:15.083
some subject like intellectuals.

238
00:12:15.083 --> 00:12:19.000
What's necessary is bringing
 that spirituality into life,

239
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:23.750
practicing it. The fourth tendency,

240
00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.708
demonic tendency -

241
00:12:25.708 --> 00:12:28.750
This sometimes appears clearly, sometimes not.

242
00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:29.666
And here

243
00:12:29.666 --> 00:12:33.625
asura doesn't mean some demon or monster,

244
00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:37.375
here asura means that tendency

245
00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:41.875
which is against the Lord and spirituality.

246
00:12:41.875 --> 00:12:45.083
Where someone starts considering
 spirituality itself foolishness,

247
00:12:45.083 --> 00:12:49.708
doesn't believe in the Lord and

248
00:12:49.708 --> 00:12:53.333
starts teaching this to others too.

249
00:12:53.333 --> 00:12:54.958
Family members'

250
00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:58.333
help is necessary in two ways in this -

251
00:12:58.333 --> 00:13:05.458
one is that they protect themselves
 from someone else's this tendency,

252
00:13:05.458 --> 00:13:08.875
and second is that they also

253
00:13:08.875 --> 00:13:10.500
try to pull such a tendency

254
00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:14.500
person toward spirituality.

255
00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.416
Regular study of scriptures,

256
00:13:17.416 --> 00:13:21.375
putting spirituality in one's routine,

257
00:13:21.375 --> 00:13:25.000
reading this Gita, etc.

258
00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.250
All these will be helpful

259
00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.583
in keeping family members away

260
00:13:29.583 --> 00:13:31.583
from these tendencies.

261
00:13:35.916 --> 00:13:37.375
At the workplace

262
00:13:37.375 --> 00:13:43.916
sometimes you have to face
 some such colleagues or officers

263
00:13:43.916 --> 00:13:48.208
who always maintain uncooperative behavior,

264
00:13:48.208 --> 00:13:52.791
or do less help and more criticism.

265
00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:54.416
Their this tendency

266
00:13:54.416 --> 00:13:57.125
is an indication

267
00:13:57.125 --> 00:13:59.333
that spirituality

268
00:13:59.333 --> 00:14:02.333
is missing from their life.

269
00:14:02.333 --> 00:14:03.833
These tendencies

270
00:14:03.833 --> 00:14:07.291
are also a reflection

271
00:14:07.291 --> 00:14:08.750
of those obstacles

272
00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:13.583
that prevent people from surrendering to Me.

273
00:14:13.583 --> 00:14:15.833
Understanding these tendencies

274
00:14:15.833 --> 00:14:17.666
will help you

275
00:14:17.666 --> 00:14:21.125
solve such challenges.

276
00:14:21.125 --> 00:14:26.250
First, the tendency of foolishness -

277
00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.375
Just continuing to do one's work

278
00:14:28.375 --> 00:14:31.458
in that same old way,

279
00:14:31.458 --> 00:14:36.875
not trying to change within oneself.

280
00:14:36.875 --> 00:14:40.041
Even if someone suggests
 a new and better path,

281
00:14:40.041 --> 00:14:45.833
remaining stuck on one's old path.

282
00:14:45.833 --> 00:14:47.916
If this isn't foolishness,

283
00:14:47.916 --> 00:14:50.541
then what is?

284
00:14:50.541 --> 00:14:54.083
These people not only stop
 their personal development,

285
00:14:54.083 --> 00:14:59.833
but also slow the organization's progress.

286
00:14:59.833 --> 00:15:01.541
For such people,

287
00:15:01.541 --> 00:15:03.791
regular training,

288
00:15:03.791 --> 00:15:07.166
removing them from old work

289
00:15:07.166 --> 00:15:09.125
and putting them in some new work

290
00:15:09.125 --> 00:15:11.958
can prove helpful.

291
00:15:11.958 --> 00:15:14.458
The second tendency,

292
00:15:14.458 --> 00:15:16.583
narādhamāḥ -

293
00:15:16.583 --> 00:15:20.458
that is the tendency to fall down,

294
00:15:20.458 --> 00:15:22.833
towards downfall.

295
00:15:22.833 --> 00:15:26.083
These are those people who,

296
00:15:26.083 --> 00:15:29.791
even despite having talent and capability,

297
00:15:29.791 --> 00:15:32.916
don't fulfill their responsibilities.

298
00:15:32.916 --> 00:15:35.208
Having capability but

299
00:15:35.208 --> 00:15:38.500
still not fulfilling one's duty

300
00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:42.500
is a sign of laziness.

301
00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.916
And laziness is a

302
00:15:44.916 --> 00:15:48.291
very big cause of downfall.

303
00:15:48.291 --> 00:15:52.833
Such persons also need harsh words

304
00:15:52.833 --> 00:15:55.666
and inspiration.

305
00:15:55.666 --> 00:16:00.125
Harsh words so they fulfill their responsibility,

306
00:16:00.125 --> 00:16:04.916
and when with their skill they complete work,

307
00:16:04.916 --> 00:16:07.666
then their appreciation should be done.

308
00:16:07.666 --> 00:16:08.833
Slowly

309
00:16:08.833 --> 00:16:13.583
with this inspiration, sense of
 responsibility will awaken

310
00:16:13.583 --> 00:16:16.416
and laziness will decrease.

311
00:16:16.416 --> 00:16:19.041
The third tendency,

312
00:16:19.041 --> 00:16:20.791
of knowledge

313
00:16:20.791 --> 00:16:23.291
being stolen by māyā.

314
00:16:23.291 --> 00:16:27.875
These people are endowed
 with intellect and capability,

315
00:16:27.875 --> 00:16:31.208
but ego of this very thing

316
00:16:31.208 --> 00:16:36.000
creates obstacles in a harmonious environment.

317
00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:39.666
They understand that only their path is right

318
00:16:39.666 --> 00:16:41.750
and others' wrong.

319
00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:46.916
They always reject others' suggestions.

320
00:16:46.916 --> 00:16:49.125
These people can be made part

321
00:16:49.125 --> 00:16:53.208
of some such projects,

322
00:16:53.208 --> 00:16:59.000
where their victory depends on others’ help.

323
00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:05.791
Something where they can't
 move forward without cooperation.

324
00:17:05.791 --> 00:17:10.166
This will awaken respect for others in them.

325
00:17:10.166 --> 00:17:13.083
The fourth tendency is

326
00:17:13.083 --> 00:17:15.041
demonic tendency.

327
00:17:15.041 --> 00:17:19.083
These people deliberately rebel.

328
00:17:19.083 --> 00:17:21.125
They create useless tension

329
00:17:21.125 --> 00:17:24.500
and spoil the workplace environment.

330
00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:28.625
With these people, a strict and

331
00:17:28.625 --> 00:17:29.458
at the same time

332
00:17:29.458 --> 00:17:33.416
gentle approach of explaining must be adopted.

333
00:17:33.416 --> 00:17:37.000
Strictness to tell them

334
00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:40.583
that such behavior is completely inappropriate,

335
00:17:40.583 --> 00:17:44.500
and then with peace it must be explained

336
00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:48.000
that they're harming themselves,

337
00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.125
and how they can progress
 by applying this power

338
00:17:51.125 --> 00:17:55.541
in the right place.

339
00:17:55.541 --> 00:18:00.416
The importance of cooperation
 must be explained to them.

340
00:18:00.416 --> 00:18:03.291
For senior officers in the organization,

341
00:18:03.291 --> 00:18:05.458
it becomes necessary

342
00:18:05.458 --> 00:18:11.833
that they recognize the tendencies
 given here and their signs,

343
00:18:11.833 --> 00:18:15.000
and then take appropriate steps.

344
00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:18.708
Otherwise, just as these tendencies

345
00:18:18.708 --> 00:18:23.250
prevent surrender to Me,

346
00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.750
similarly they'll also become obstacles

347
00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:29.875
in the organization's progress.
